SUMMARY:Beach Guild of Fine Art\, Fall Show & Sale
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Art in the Beach with us! November 13th-15th the Beach Guild of Fine Art is holding our Annual Fall Show & Sale at 140 Wineva Ave. in The Beaches. Free Admission. \nSee original artwork in a variety of mediums\, sizes and subjects. Something for everyone!\nFriday Nov. 13th 5 – 8PM\nSaturday Nov. 14th 10AM – 5PM\nSunday Nov. 15th 10AM – 5PM \nFor Additional information about Beach Guild of Fine Arts see: www.beachguildoffineart.com
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/beach-guild-of-fine-art-fall-show-sale/
LOCATION:Beach United Church\, 140 Wineva Ave.\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25221312/E-MAIL-BLAST_BGFA_FallShow2026_7.84x5.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Beach Guild of Fine Art":MAILTO:bgfapromo@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
