SUMMARY:The Beach and East Toronto Historical Society presents Military Historian Marcus Nicoletti
DESCRIPTION:Marcus will give a talk entitled ‘From Kingston Road to Calais\, Local Heroes from the Great War 1914-1918’\, and will discuss the many men and women from the Beach and East End who served overseas during The First World War. In addition\, there will be a collection of military artifacts and memorabilia on display. Admission is free. All welcome. Info: www.tbeths.com
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/the-beach-and-east-toronto-historical-society-presents-military-historian-marcus-nicoletti/
LOCATION:Beach United Church\, 140 Wineva Ave.\, Toronto
